e/godot/pull/105825.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105825.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-13T21:28:00Z"},"body":"Fixed #105775 \r\n\r\nBefore : \"Right\" and \"Bottom\" limits for Camera2D clamped camera's position based on top-left corner of screen rect plus a certain constant. This meant that when the camera was rotated, the limits weren't computed properly since the offset was constant, which meant the limits used to behave weird.\r\n\r\nNow : for \"Right\" and \"Bottom\" limits, clamp the position of camera based on the bottom-right corner of the camera, just as it is with \"Top\" and \"Left\" limits with the top-left corner. Now, even when the camera is rotated the limits behave properly.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105825/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105825/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}